OL,3,CPeter Reid 'honoured' to do the Great
OL,4,CNorth Run aged 70 for Sir Bobby
OL,6,FFormer England midfielder Peter Reid
OL,7,Fis raising funds for the Sir Bobby
OL,8,FRobson Foundation by taking part in
OL,9,Fthe Great North Run at the age of 70.
OL,11,FThe late Sir Bobby's charity is
OL,12,Fraising funds towards a new cancer-
OL,13,Ffighting institute in Newcastle which
OL,14,Fwill become a world-leading cancer
OL,15,Fdrug trials centre, costing #30
OL,16,Fmillion.
