OL,3,CPeter Reid 'honoured' to do the Great
OL,4,CNorth Run aged 70 for Sir Bobby
OL,6,FReid, who played for Sir Bobby's
OL,7,FEngland team in the mid-1980s, will
OL,8,Fjoin a team of fundraising runners for
OL,9,Fthe half-marathon from Newcastle to
OL,10,FSouth Shields on Sunday 13 September.
OL,12,FThe former Sunderland manager, who
OL,13,Fturned 70 in June, said: "I've done a
OL,14,Ffew 10ks over the years but when I
OL,15,Fheard about The Sir Bobby Robson
OL,16,FFoundation, and everything it's trying
OL,17,Fto do building this new institute, I
OL,18,Fwanted to help.
OL,26,@uD@ZOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1787581102
OL,3,CPeter Reid 'honoured' to do the Great
OL,4,CNorth Run aged 70 for Sir Bobby
OL,6,F"My 70th feels like a landmark, and I
OL,7,Fquite like working towards goals so
OL,8,Fthis felt right.
OL,10,F"You read so many things about cancer
OL,11,Fand obviously we lost Sir Bobby and
OL,12,Fmore recently Kevin Keegan to it.
OL,14,F"Really, you think, there but for the
OL,15,Fgrace of God go I.
OL,17,F"My daughter had cervical cancer and
OL,18,Fthankfully her treatment was
OL,19,Fsuccessful but cancer is something we
OL,20,Fall live with.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1787581102
OL,3,CPeter Reid 'honoured' to do the Great
OL,4,CNorth Run aged 70 for Sir Bobby
OL,6,F"We can fight against cancer together
OL,7,Fand I'm proud to be running for Sir
OL,8,FBobby's Foundation.
OL,10,F"He was a wonderful man, a really warm
OL,11,Fman who was always great with me.
OL,13,F"It will be an honour to do the Great
OL,14,FNorth Run for his charity."
OL,16,FIt will mark 40 years since Reid
OL,17,Fplayed for England against Argentina
OL,18,Fin Mexico, when Diego Maradona scored
OL,19,Fthe Hand of God goal and another of
OL,20,Findividual brilliance.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUuD@AOUvD@[O]
