OL,3,CPeter Reid 'honoured' to do the Great
OL,4,CNorth Run aged 70 for Sir Bobby
OL,6,FOthers joining Sir Bobby's Team on the
OL,7,Fday will be cancer patients, clinical
OL,8,Ftrials researchers, construction
OL,9,Fworkers from the institute site and
OL,10,Fmembers of the much-loved manager's
OL,11,Ffamily.
OL,13,FSir Bobby's son Mark, who is
OL,14,Ffoundation chairman, said: "Dad called
OL,15,Fhis foundation his 'last and greatest
OL,16,Fteam', and we're very grateful to
OL,17,Feveryone taking on this challenge for
OL,18,Fus."
OL,26,@vD@\OUzD@DO]
